{"texts": ["STATE COMMITTEE FOR FISHERIES\nOF THE RUSSIAN FEDERATION\n12, Rozhdestvensky blvd., Moscow, 103031, Russia\nTel: +7 (095) 928 28 73, 928 12-96, Fax: +7 (095) 921 34 63\n_____________________________________________________________________________\nRe:First International Specialized Fishery Exhibition \u201cFish Resources 2002\u201d,Moscow,Russia\nDear Sirs,\nFrom 26 to 30 June, 2002 the State Committee for Fisheries of the Russian Federation will hold in\nMoscow the First International Specialized Fishery Exhibition \u201c Fish Resources 2002\u201d on the\nterritory of the All-Russian Exhibition Center in the \u201cFishery\u201d pavilion.\nThe Federal State Unitary Enterprise \u201c National Fish Resources\u201d of the State Committee for\nFisheries of the Russian Federation is in charge with organizing the Exhibition.\nThe All- Russian Exhibition Center traditionally is the main Exhibition Complex of Russia. The\nunique branch \u201c Fishery\u201d pavilion located on its territory is now the center for holding social and\nadministrative events with the participation of companies and institutions of Russian fishery branch,\nincluding educational and scientific institutions, fishing, processing and trade organizations.\nThe Exhibition\u2019s program will cover scientific-practical Conference and all the possibilities for\nvarious business contacts will be granted.\nObviously the Exhibition will promote broadening mutually beneficial cooperation, rational\nutilization of aquatic bioresources, attracting investments, will provide a powerful impetus to the\npromotion of national fish products and scientific projection to the Russian and foreign markets.\nI am pleased to invite you in our Exhibition \u201c Fish Resources-2002\u201d.\nI am sure that the Exhibition will enable you to find new business partners and realize your plans.\nSincerely yours,\nEvgeny I. Nazdratenko\nChairman of the State Committee\nFor Fisheries of the Russian Federation\nThe First  International Fishery Exhibition\n \u00abFISH RESOURCES  2002\u201d\nDear Sirs!\nWe have the honour to invite you to take part in the First International Fishery\nExhibition \u00ab Fish Resources - 2002 \u00bb, which will be held from 26 to30 June, 2002 on the\nterritory of the All-Russian Exhibition Center in the branch \"Fishery\" pavilion and we hope\nthat your participation in the Exhibition will help you to find business partners and will\npromote realization of your plans for the future.\nExhibition organizers:\nState Committee for Fisheries of the Russian Federation\nFSUE \u00ab National fish resources \u00bb\nExhibition Dates\nInstallation: 23-25 June, 2002.\nWork: 26-30 June, 2002.\nDismantling: 01-02 July, 2002.\nOfficial opening day 26 June, 2002 at 12.00\nExhibition Place:\nVVC, \"Fishery\" pavilion,\nProspect Mira, Moscow, 129223, Russia\nContact telephones of the Exhibition administration: (095) 181-09-18,181-29-50,923-82-90\nTel/fax: (095) 181-09-73, 925-47-31; E-mail: nfr-vo@aha.ru\nThe basic thematic directions:\n\u00b7 Industrial fishery, fishery and sea products equipment.  Systems of control and\nmanagement for fishery\n\u00b7 Equipment and technologies of commodity fish-farming and reproduction of fish\nstocks\n\u00b7 Fishery industry fleet, fishing vessels equipment and radioelectronics\n\u00b7 Engineering and technology of fish processing, packing machines and materials,\nrefrigeration engineering\n\u00b7 Samples of ready fish products\n\u00b7 Cargo handling and warehouse equipment\n\u00b7 Net gear materials and equipment for its manufacture\n\u00b7 Safety of navigation\n\u00b7 Sports and amateur fishery\n\u00b7 Training specialists for fishery industry\nInformation support:\nMagazines: \u00ab Fishery of Russia \u00bb, \u00abFisheries \u00bb,\nNewspaper \u00ab Fishery news \u00bb\nBasic prices:\n 1 sq. \u00ec of indoor equipped space 160\n 1 sq. \u00ec of indoor non-equipped space 140\n 1 sq. \u00ec of outdoor space  40\n\u00b7  VAT is included.\n\u00b7  invoice is  in USD.\nThe First International Fishery Exhibition\n\u201cFISH RESOURCES 2002\u201d\nPARTICIPAT\nAPPLICATION FORM\nThe application is to be sent before   \nMarch 01, 2002 by address\nVVC \u00abFishery\u00bb pavilion( \u00b938)  ,\nprospect Mira, 129223, Moscow,\nRussia", "\u201cFISH RESOURCES 2002\u201d\nPARTICIPAT\nAPPLICATION FORM\nThe application is to be sent before   \nMarch 01, 2002 by address\nVVC \u00abFishery\u00bb pavilion( \u00b938)  ,\nprospect Mira, 129223, Moscow,\nRussia\nPh.: +7 (095) 181-09-18, 923-82-90, 181-29-50\nPhone/fax:+7  (095) 181-09-73, 925-47-31\nE-mail: nfr-vo@aha.ru\nWe ask to register our organization as an exhibitor of \u201cFish Resources 2002\u201d Exhibition and to send us the\ncomplete set of Conditions for participation.\nName of the organization Responsible person for participation   in\nthe Exhibition\nSurname\nBank account essential elements Name\nPosition\n   Address Contact phone (code)\nTel\nCity Fax\nCountry E-mail_______________________\nPAYMENT FOR PARTICIPATION Price Unit of\nmeasure\nQuantity Total( USD)\nIndoor equipped space 160 sq. \u00ec\nIndoor non- equipped space 140 sq. \u00ec\nOutdoor space 40 sq. \u00ec\nAddition equipment,\nservices\n1. \n2. \n3. \n4.\n\u2022 Admission fee of 100 USD and the payment of total cost are made within 5(five)\ndays after signing the contract.\n\u2022 VAT is included.\n\u2022 The invoice is in USD.\nManager\nSignature Decoding of the signature                         Data"], "vectors": [[-0.006068400107324123, 0.03944433480501175, -0.02795860916376114, -0.01089490670710802, 0.018093422055244446, 0.022957608103752136, -0.03875990957021713, 0.01721568964421749, -0.035146504640579224, -0.025510460138320923, -0.0872797891497612, -0.0057518663816154, -0.05931935831904411, 0.08452488481998444, -0.10746024549007416, -0.05103343352675438, 0.03549699857831001, -0.02784152701497078, -0.03669555112719536, 0.03340078145265579, 0.03833326697349548, -0.02411404624581337, 0.